.SH CHEMISTRY

Exact atomic weight is not determined yet, partially because its half-life,
which some people call "mean time between changes," is short.  But values
indicated by \fIps\fP(1) and \fIsize\fP(1) show that it is less than others.
It has several isotopes, which are listed in COMPILE TIME OPTIONS section of
this manual.  Research is still under progress.  Your help is appreciated.

